data: {"type":"diagnosis","timestamp":"2026-08-20T06:35:19.733Z","data":{"diagnosis":"### Forensic Investigation Diagnosis\n\n**Target Channel:** `ch-01` | **Investigation Window:** `2026-08-14T19:00:00.000Z` to `2026-08-14T19:15:00.000Z` (UTC)\n\n**Findings:**\nTelemetry analysis indicates insufficient qualifying evidence in this window. No cohort met the statistical significance threshold of cues >= 20.\n\n**Conclusion:**\nInsufficient eligible sample size to evaluate incident failure thresholds. No isolated root cause, on-air slate bleed, or financial loss is asserted.\n\n**Operational Remediation Proposal:**\n- No remediation action required for this window.","grounding":{"grounded":true,"violations":[],"checkedClaims":1}}}

